title AVG-03 AVG Verifies VP (OID4VP) and Delivers Signed Result
fontsize 20
gap 205
participant Calling_Agent
participant MBI
participant AVG
participant Zetrix_Chain
participant Service
==STEPS 6 TO 7A==
Calling_Agent->MBI:6. create VP (revealed claims, signed over x401 challenge)
MBI-->Calling_Agent:VP
Calling_Agent->AVG:7. submit VP (OID4VP, proofRequestId)
AVG->AVG:proof request exists, not expired, not used; mark used
AVG->Zetrix_Chain:7a. read issuer key + VC status
Zetrix_Chain-->AVG:issuer key, status
AVG->AVG:check in order: (1) challenge + signature (2) Zetrix issuer from AVG config (3) not revoked (4) not expired (5) credential type (6) requested claims present
==STEPS 8A TO 8C==
AVG->AVG:sign result with service HMAC secret; log attempt (no claim values, 30 days)
AVG-->Calling_Agent:8a. signed result (true + disclosed claims)
Calling_Agent->Service:8b. forward signed result in PROOF-RESPONSE header
Service->Service:recompute HMAC with own secret; match proofRequestId
Service-->Calling_Agent:serve the call
AVG-->Service:8c. POST same signed result to callback URL (always)
Service->Service:check HMAC; treat header + callback for same proofRequestId as one result
alt ANY CHECK FAILS
AVG-->Calling_Agent:8a. signed result (false + reason code)
Calling_Agent->Service:8b. forward
Service-->Calling_Agent:refuse, with reason
end
alt RESULT TAMPERED
Service-->Calling_Agent:refuse (HMAC_MISMATCH)
end
alt ZETRIX CHAIN UNREADABLE (FAIL CLOSED)
AVG-->Calling_Agent:signed result (false, VERIFIER_UNAVAILABLE)
end
alt CALLBACK NOT ANSWERED (NO 2XX IN 5 S)
AVG->AVG:retry after 5 s, 30 s, 2 min, then log CALLBACK_FAILED
end
